NEW RECRUIT FAQ -- HIDDEN SAND VILLAGE

Q: Who leads the village?
A: Lord Gaara, the Fifth Kazekage, host of the One-Tail. The Kazekage is the
strongest shinobi of the Sand and the protector of us all.

Q: What chakra nature should I expect to train?
A: Wind (Fuuton) is the heart of Sunagakure's arts. Many recruits also learn
supporting earth or lightning. Sand manipulation is reserved for those with a
rare affinity -- do not expect it.

Q: What are the Sand's famous techniques?
A: Wind release, and above all the Puppet Technique of our celebrated Puppet
Brigade. Ask the Workshop if the craft calls to you.

Q: Who are the Sand Siblings?
A: Temari, Kankuro, and Lord Gaara -- children of the Fourth Kazekage and among
the village's finest. You may serve under them.

Q: How do I advance in rank?
A: Genin to chunin by examination and merit; see the promotion criteria. Serve
well, honor the alliance with the Leaf, and respect the desert.
